id: pm-brief-l5lh
title: Checkout release alert script from the default branch
description: "Greptile found on pm-beads PR #80 that workflow_dispatch from a divergent or older ref can make the alert job check out that rejected ref, where scripts/alert-on-release-failure.sh may not exist. Harden the merged pm-brief reference workflow so the nonblocking alert always executes the trusted script from the repository default branch."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-24T15:42:34.069Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-24T15:50:24.936Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-24T15:50:24.927Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-24T15:50:24.927Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "The alert checkout explicitly uses github.event.repository.default_branch; The YAML verifier and runtime tests fail if the trusted ref wiring is removed; Full release:check, packed acceptance, coverage, audit, PM validation, and reconciliation pass"
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
environment: GitHub Actions workflow_dispatch on a divergent ref
repro_steps: "Dispatch .github/workflows/release.yml from a ref predating the tracked alert script, then force the release job to fail; the alert checkout follows the event ref and cannot invoke the script."
resolution: Pinned the alert checkout to the repository default branch without persisted credentials; made failed issue lookup skip mutation; upgraded the exact development CLI/SDK contract to 2026.8.24.
expected_result: "Divergent manual dispatches execute the trusted alert script, lookup failures cannot create duplicate issues, and alert failures remain nonblocking."
actual_result: Five hermetic alert tests and the YAML verifier pass; the 2026.8.24 compatibility contract passes and the remaining initial full-suite tests were green.
affected_version: 2026.8.24
fixed_version: 2026.8.24
component: release-workflow
regression: true
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-24T15:50:01.224Z","harness:codex","Review audit also found the merged reference coerced a failed dedup lookup to an empty result and could create a duplicate. Hardened both invariants: default-branch checkout and fail-closed lookup."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,Trusted default-branch checkout
  scripts/alert-on-release-failure.sh,project,Fail-closed dedup lookup
tests[1]{command,path,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/alert-on-release-failure.test.ts,test/alert-on-release-failure.test.ts,project,"harness:codex","2026-08-24T15:50:01.224Z",local_mutation,codex/release-alert-default-branch
close_reason: The trusted checkout and fail-closed deduplication invariants are implemented with package-local proof.
body: ""
